{"catch":"一款以榮譽、競爭與校園戰鬥為主題的戰略角色扮演遊戲。","desc":"《Banchou Tactics: Lion Heart》是一款回合制策略角色扮演遊戲，靈感來自日本不良少年漫畫與校園勢力之間的競爭。\n率領一群強悍的學生，掌握他們各自獨特的能力，在充滿熱血與魄力的激烈戰鬥中一路奮戰。謹慎部署隊伍、善用每位角色的優勢，並在這段關於尊嚴、友情與激烈競爭的故事中脫穎而出。","publisher":"CORECELL","release":"2026-09-10","genres":["模擬 / 角色扮演 / 動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","德文","意大利文","泰文"],"size":"Switch 2 6.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/734d405787305d0f64d0c877ffe5ac5a2f89a6600f7110b51bd1c33bf3a7033d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5feca788938acb115440de504646b9d73facb762ac0736d2ba2285cf8c62def5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/66a4e3510f5dd54c88627dcbde55b34ef6a3e5440b0376620f1aa219ee41a948.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/500216319b8a59bc0baee91a900e4bdf5567ed36d9d217bbb8e8454186911d24.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3575903cf1c99995ca6cd042e5f61e60f7ff1216a4691e56f5e54530f93a9545.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51747ff01380f9cee4f79636cb7ac6ee4453a40fd0e8c7ed9e2eeca24fa4f64b.jpg"]}